      "note": [
        "Population refers to persons recorded in the population register of all ages for the variables Sex breakdown, percent and Age, percent. The variable Education level, percent refers to persons recorded in the population register aged 20–64 years. From the 2001-01-01 version concerning the year 2000, the Register of Education (UREG) underwent extensive quality improvements which leads to a break in the time series and means that comparisons with previous versions of the register must be done with great caution – for information see [Quality improvement in the Register of Education, 2000 (in Swedish))(https://www.scb.se/hitta-statistik/statistik-efter-amne/utbildning-samt-forskning-inom-hogskolan/befolkningens-utbildning-och-studiedeltagande/befolkningens-utbildning/produktrelaterat/Fordjupad-information/kvalitetshojningen-i-utbildningsregistret-ar-2000/).",
